d problem-solving take center stage, not violence and blood.\n\nCollect items while being chased by something unknown.\n\nYou'll explore a dark and threatening cabin with outdoor areas, and an unwelcome guest could be lurking around any corner. Forgotten Possessions is a gripping horror adventure from start to finish, leaving you breathless.\n\n# Features\n\n- Collect items for a mysterious person in exchange for handy equipment\n- Detailed and atmospheric environment\n- A truly eerie creature\n- An exciting blend of horror and adventure\n- There are many dark secrets to uncover.\n\n# Why Early Access?\nAs a solo indie developer, I want to collect feedback from real players in a controlled feedback loop as early as possible so that the game becomes successful! At the same time, I want to provide interested players with the fun at a reduced price as quickly as possible.\n\n**Your benefits:**\n\n1. Reduced price compared to the full release price\n2. Contribute your ideas, suggestions, and feedback using the integrated meta-tools\n3. Have fun with the latest game updates exclusively for Early Access players\n4. Be part of a growing community.\n", "short_description": "A nerve-wrecking horror adventure game where exploration, hiding, and problem-solving take center stage, not violence and blood."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.glock-software.de/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Glock Software", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://new.express.adobe.com/webpage/TrGbP9J57KQRc", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb